    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0023",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p146-02115-s003",
      "sentenceText": "As Mary and Liz mentioned, they do not have any particular diagnosable psychopathologies: rather, difficulty forming relationships with others seems to be at the core of most of these readers’ problems.",
      "sentenceSha256": "eeebae2c851a866da7f468a8dbd05fded869b5e72ec9bf8c312e24706e4c8eee",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p146-02115-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-013",
      "parentFingerprint": "8358dc07ec490e5bc59c420bfb8fc1cd4d135ce20c8a08d20af0d08f1226a3c7",
      "passageSha256": "18620f30c066c4c0ce6764e3b723feba3297882652c41764cb6a24a0dac46066",
      "pdfPages": [
        146
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0024",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p146-03870-s002",
      "sentenceText": "But here are a few suggestions for people struggling with childhood instability.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8ec7b3fab18e2fe4eea763422289a0c17afd2843aa0d258259cfa505183be259",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p146-03870-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-015",
      "parentFingerprint": "69e7bf39697e6709a75c50b1f01a545987b94975dc1ab4bfb5d4edd39457b8d1",
      "passageSha256": "2fea61f6c5eaf2e7e676310c1c26ce6c98cbbd77bb53097d79f10657335e6405",
      "pdfPages": [
        146
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0025",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p146-06202-s001",
      "sentenceText": "I read with interest this morning a report on your recent paper dealing with children who move frequently (UVA Today).",
      "sentenceSha256": "b068ad98ef54aa3f85c2ff0e41a34076306f9ff8b1ba7f11f6cf25e923294531",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p146-06202-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-018",
      "parentFingerprint": "a18cefe83d8191b99d81518890207616211114d5df56babdde11787e4713fffc",
      "passageSha256": "c671ccd1b5fe1be6ed2a4ca0a9d57f47d65c0c744b3639aa8cf1b6817a029322",
      "pdfPages": [
        146
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0026",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p146-06202-s003",
      "sentenceText": "Once we",
      "sentenceSha256": "2ee0b3fac201c512c46f840d660ebfe1e0436b2b464f9fa6d0d2bd904f9458bd",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-00750-r001-001",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-019",
      "parentFingerprint": "b6a35d7b02e0543047255fc63edfc4bb1a84f6e1f3e2288f36464032f581c09e",
      "passageSha256": "7cdca86976010367b22eb13634651383171b17e1214b4669085762f43846b1e0",
      "pdfPages": [
        146,
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0027",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-01140-s001",
      "sentenceText": "I found, quite consciously while growing up, that it was very important to gain rapid peer respect among some group at each new school and in each new neighborhood.",
      "sentenceSha256": "da08acbfe0430149b353f75d56d0a64b48952ad0de7ef76cae97114625034145",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-01140-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-020",
      "parentFingerprint": "cf29797be10d185aff3897d5def2ac891a9c488e2c98887528008cd3bb4a48ee",
      "passageSha256": "97212a02dc98a4bba64bf66fc7258d7d69c417c2fc621f391016714120956192",
      "pdfPages": [
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0028",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-01140-s004",
      "sentenceText": "I’m not sure how valuable anecdotal information like mine is to you, but I’d be happy to trade thoughts about it with you anytime.",
      "sentenceSha256": "7bfbcaaeffdbd66e32117495adf739bc1870049f191fc8522fd049b1be653aa4",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-01140-r004-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-021",
      "parentFingerprint": "57a047f718b7049cb8ed02188f790b35f6023be100a652b36e4561183b2e4c98",
      "passageSha256": "efcd76a257de9a39f8227bc55f011d837bed8956fe9164317f4e372222efcd3b",
      "pdfPages": [
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0029",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Finally, D.J. moved over forty-five times in his life and went to eleven different schools in twelve years.",
      "sentenceSha256": "8f423c2ca2ccac81e6fc36be5beecd25960aad7948596cf5dddaa97e55ccd36b",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "450b36ae621140faee0c5e26385c48c50c0ca9fe57d266b8db188fcb3108574d",
      "passageSha256": "3ae45bf9893c8b56bfd84c605c8cfd6626b46c0098fddefd853aa3744357f753",
      "pdfPages": [
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0030",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-s002",
      "sentenceText": "He compared his life to that of a friend from third grade in Colorado, who still lives in the same area and only left to serve in the air force for a few years before returning.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1c0cd0597ae5c4897559a46f278e10abacbe017e8751d34e5779fe178289a1ea",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "450b36ae621140faee0c5e26385c48c50c0ca9fe57d266b8db188fcb3108574d",
      "passageSha256": "3ae45bf9893c8b56bfd84c605c8cfd6626b46c0098fddefd853aa3744357f753",
      "pdfPages": [
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0031",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-s003",
      "sentenceText": "His friend thinks he is crazy for moving so much, and D.J. thinks his friend is crazy for staying in the same place.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e9d853a2b5cd498ca69525078e81a01a61f023d955d3b6fbc2640ddd9e1d2526",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-022",
      "parentFingerprint": "450b36ae621140faee0c5e26385c48c50c0ca9fe57d266b8db188fcb3108574d",
      "passageSha256": "3ae45bf9893c8b56bfd84c605c8cfd6626b46c0098fddefd853aa3744357f753",
      "pdfPages": [
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0032",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-s005",
      "sentenceText": "His friend has a hard time remembering particular years or when things happened to him.",
      "sentenceSha256": "0c71b069670c54d585260a37c2030c74df8b50351282ad3db5c7c0f2f66ba58b",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "cdcac90397c30f22cc61449e0643f5a3804497d4d33c3d1bb38d3d69cdef3d39",
      "passageSha256": "cd63f9c04fdb24a5629d77604601b863b3ede95d4c36fec3e3a0c973abc2d064",
      "pdfPages": [
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0033",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-s008",
      "sentenceText": "Most revealingly, he summarizes his views: “I think satisfaction can be found in both lifestyles.",
      "sentenceSha256": "1b2981f801d25ce4107a24e413703c399ba3a33a013315f3c144ab3bc08b6f57",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-03675-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-023",
      "parentFingerprint": "cdcac90397c30f22cc61449e0643f5a3804497d4d33c3d1bb38d3d69cdef3d39",
      "passageSha256": "cd63f9c04fdb24a5629d77604601b863b3ede95d4c36fec3e3a0c973abc2d064",
      "pdfPages": [
        147
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0034",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-06210-s001",
      "sentenceText": "With as many moves as D.J. has experienced, for him there is no such thing as too many moves or too much richness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "086f81e0d8ef90cc554e1f3b9b74b821881a3bd3f5919a68ea3d8de27d960f1f",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-06210-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "01ee63b25bcbf5825be867da4933b2407fc0734a908563128ac4613ec3ad1a32",
      "passageSha256": "0c00810254f87909fd3030ff691002fbf75e4821a52db73df0a676eba1074284",
      "pdfPages": [
        147,
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0035",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s01-p147-06210-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In contrast, for Mary, Liz, Gus, Peggy, and Jim, eight to thirteen moves were definitely too much.",
      "sentenceSha256": "230f8f449a6ba482067039fb16ba82cd3fcba92aa8cdcaf2f81359c7dc91274d",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s01-p147-06210-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-025",
      "parentFingerprint": "01ee63b25bcbf5825be867da4933b2407fc0734a908563128ac4613ec3ad1a32",
      "passageSha256": "0c00810254f87909fd3030ff691002fbf75e4821a52db73df0a676eba1074284",
      "pdfPages": [
        147,
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0036",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Speaking of extremity, have you heard of a twenty-four-hour concert?",
      "sentenceSha256": "d8fefe92b15176a885b3b077f9f2d16026320f4efdad7878c1f92ccd2d39d98b",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "4681547c6509dafd66f58e0158fd855f5f5d80f47177de04b368e8cbbac997d4",
      "passageSha256": "67daadee36d4c2f6488f5fbde388ae7c759b2cfbaa3916ba08404d19791340f3",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0037",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-s002",
      "sentenceText": "No, it is not a recorded concert that you can listen to anytime you want.",
      "sentenceSha256": "3d6253c5497e80fe9b49a96025746f42d55963823cccc5bcf76b73bb38cfb1c4",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "4681547c6509dafd66f58e0158fd855f5f5d80f47177de04b368e8cbbac997d4",
      "passageSha256": "67daadee36d4c2f6488f5fbde388ae7c759b2cfbaa3916ba08404d19791340f3",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0038",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-s003",
      "sentenceText": "It is a twenty-four-hour live concert!",
      "sentenceSha256": "c94978ea284df8601fd8a3cb6ad3d231ab8cc90f7ccf630feeeb82d8bee266cb",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-026",
      "parentFingerprint": "4681547c6509dafd66f58e0158fd855f5f5d80f47177de04b368e8cbbac997d4",
      "passageSha256": "67daadee36d4c2f6488f5fbde388ae7c759b2cfbaa3916ba08404d19791340f3",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0039",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-s005",
      "sentenceText": "The critic Wesley Morris praised the show in The New York Times: “Mr. Mac gave me one of the great experiences of my life….",
      "sentenceSha256": "f539cafcb6e1ce59fdaf967e03d1cb19539c75b2cf5dbd2278ef167cc41e0ed0",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-01650-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-027",
      "parentFingerprint": "310c861831969349049be2d6037e05bff5ad898bab05f6b11636ba88c521b684",
      "passageSha256": "fcef0c531ce9a206804f422773e11afcf278943c132f42d5ed490461962118cb",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0040",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Who would voluntarily deprive themselves of sleep and sit on an uncomfortable chair all day?",
      "sentenceSha256": "45fb36a95838a208c98e6605bc7058638391e31f7d2ffefaea4fc4068b6705f3",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "40feb36df425dd3fbc69ea05bff73f42051d062b004a0c1019e0a7c39fbbbe0a",
      "passageSha256": "9fb17bfaa5ca7160d1ffc58167c2e0f1a8dab67eab74a8b0e0ce0d762c9a53ef",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0041",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-s003",
      "sentenceText": "I was surprised to learn that 850 people were crazy enough to pay to be there.",
      "sentenceSha256": "62d57b4ad92f6d4e4a8120fb50dfa6c3b59184653a8cfecb3118d200a0daf9a2",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-028",
      "parentFingerprint": "40feb36df425dd3fbc69ea05bff73f42051d062b004a0c1019e0a7c39fbbbe0a",
      "passageSha256": "9fb17bfaa5ca7160d1ffc58167c2e0f1a8dab67eab74a8b0e0ce0d762c9a53ef",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0042",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-s005",
      "sentenceText": "Anyway, I’ll never hear the song the same way again.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "19aca0e23c688c908d01f7c0203c90b8cd33bded3665288427dfe3c89f537966",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "17ff6454dd1f625cc205125010bd8171ca24e05d65efe783ee79d6fa951dbf00",
      "passageSha256": "27b7bd89975e3581e9625e1a813366244e4199ccd78ff5672c46f19afcadfbee",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0043",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-s007",
      "sentenceText": "They felt love, empathy, and, according to Morris, “the shredding of shame.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "1190da004a1aa918bfe7e339175ed68e7134dd760e395bde29d503215af0d6df",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-03600-r005-007",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-029",
      "parentFingerprint": "17ff6454dd1f625cc205125010bd8171ca24e05d65efe783ee79d6fa951dbf00",
      "passageSha256": "27b7bd89975e3581e9625e1a813366244e4199ccd78ff5672c46f19afcadfbee",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0044",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-05745-s001",
      "sentenceText": "Morris was not alone.",
      "sentenceSha256": "80597fd0079a7a5b360b3f806aac0b31962c259af03e9f0d74cba4de81858775",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-05745-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "f55ced88aae0e8805ef69fa5a1ff424e6d8de922ced00e1450930a39bc1f40ff",
      "passageSha256": "2e9144c55eae564a3533cb90c77e7f55b80941b904fbabcf25d99ac93fb87528",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0045",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-05745-s002",
      "sentenceText": "Arts editor Alex Needham wrote in The Guardian on the same day: “Staying up for such a long time has a strange effect on one’s state of mind.",
      "sentenceSha256": "34460486fa392c91d1abcdeef28cd32f10e3a9607cb6ab5962489c2687351c6d",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-05745-r001-003",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-030",
      "parentFingerprint": "f55ced88aae0e8805ef69fa5a1ff424e6d8de922ced00e1450930a39bc1f40ff",
      "passageSha256": "2e9144c55eae564a3533cb90c77e7f55b80941b904fbabcf25d99ac93fb87528",
      "pdfPages": [
        148
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c13-0046",
      "sentenceId": "c13-s02-p148-05745-s004",
      "sentenceText": "At 7am, the Brooklyn United Marching Band, a troupe of black boys in pink caps, file on to the stage and batter the hell out of their drums to provide a seismic conclusion to ‘Move on Up,’ Curtis Mayfield’s anthem of African American pride and self-determination….",
      "sentenceSha256": "f563c9b3d73e30796a63b9965cff36f270f579a1397c4f7423905260ccd7c499",
      "readingUnitId": "c13-s02-p148-05745-r004-005",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c13-031",
